## What changed

The existing probe tree was resumed, not scrapped. The Windows SUCCESS receipt could not re-run here: this host had no PowerShell and `find_git_bash()` only looked for Git-for-Windows paths.

- Installed PowerShell 7.4.13 at `/usr/local/bin/pwsh`.
- Bound the git-bash lane to GNU bash (`/usr/bin/bash`) and labeled that honestly (`posix-gnu-bash`).
- Re-ran both named probes live, packed the catalog receipt from those raw logs, and wrote the per-unit manifest.

