| Probe | Result |
|---|---|
| Probe 1 (98/98) | 80 SUCCESS, 18 REFUSAL, 0 MANGLED; plain ASCII 14/14; silent truncation 0 |
| Probe 2 | commit_exact 14/14; refs 14/14; dangerous 0 |
| C03 here-string terminator | **PARTIAL** (refuses `P03-HERE-CLOSE` in both shells) |
| C05 single-quote wrap | **PARTIAL** (refuses apostrophe / here-markers) |
| C01, C02, C04, C06, C07 | **REFUTED** (round-trip or expected git refusal) |
| MSYS `/sdcard` rewrite | **REFUTED** here (GNU bash delivers 29 bytes exactly; that Windows finding is host-specific) |

Process SUCCESS is the completed measurement, not “no quoting defects.”

